    "markdown": "---\ntitle: \"Simulación TCL\"\nformat: html\nserver: shiny\n---\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n\n:::\n\n\n# Simulación del TCL\n\n## Controles\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<div class=\"form-group shiny-input-container\">\n<label class=\"control-label\" id=\"dist-label\" for=\"dist\">Distribución:</label>\n<div>\n<select id=\"dist\" class=\"shiny-input-select\"><option value=\"Uniforme\" selected>Uniforme</option>\n<option value=\"Binomial\">Binomial</option>\n<option value=\"Poisson\">Poisson</option>\n<option value=\"Hipergeométrica\">Hipergeométrica</option>\n<option value=\"Exponencial\">Exponencial</option></select>\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-for=\"dist\" data-nonempty=\"\">{\"plugins\":[\"selectize-plugin-a11y\"]}</script>\n</div>\n</div>\n```\n\n:::\n:::\n\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<div class=\"shiny-panel-conditional\" data-display-if=\"input.dist == &#39;Uniforme&#39;\" data-ns-prefix=\"\">\n<div class=\"form-group shiny-input-container\">\n<label class=\"control-label\" id=\"a-label\" for=\"a\">Mínimo (a):</label>\n<input id=\"a\" type=\"number\" class=\"shiny-input-number form-control\" value=\"0\" data-update-on=\"change\"/>\n</div>\n<div class=\"form-group shiny-input-container\">\n<label class=\"control-label\" id=\"b-label\" for=\"b\">Máximo (b):</label>\n<input id=\"b\" type=\"number\" class=\"shiny-input-number form-control\" value=\"1\" data-update-on=\"change\"/>\n</div>\n</div>\n```\n\n:::\n:::\n\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n::: {.cell-output .cell-output-stderr}\n\n```\nWarning: In sliderInput(): `value` should be less than or equal to `max` (value\n= 1, max = 0).\n```\n\n\n:::\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<div class=\"shiny-panel-conditional\" data-display-if=\"input.dist == &#39;Binomial&#39;\" data-ns-prefix=\"\">\n<div class=\"form-group shiny-input-container\">\n<label class=\"control-label\" id=\"size-label\" for=\"size\">Ensayos (n):</label>\n<input id=\"size\" type=\"number\" class=\"shiny-input-number form-control\" value=\"10\" data-update-on=\"change\" min=\"1\"/>\n</div>\n<div class=\"form-group shiny-input-container\">\n<label class=\"control-label\" id=\"p-label\" for=\"p\">Probabilidad (p):</label>\n<input class=\"js-range-slider\" id=\"p\" data-skin=\"shiny\" data-min=\"0.3\" data-max=\"0\" data-from=\"1\" data-step=\"0.01\" data-grid=\"true\" data-grid-num=\"10\" data-grid-snap=\"false\" data-prettify-separator=\",\" data-prettify-enabled=\"true\" data-keyboard=\"true\" data-data-type=\"number\"/>\n</div>\n</div>\n```\n\n:::\n:::\n\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<div class=\"shiny-panel-conditional\" data-display-if=\"input.dist == &#39;Poisson&#39;\" data-ns-prefix=\"\">\n<div class=\"form-group shiny-input-container\">\n<label class=\"control-label\" id=\"lambda_pois-label\" for=\"lambda_pois\">Lambda:</label>\n<input id=\"lambda_pois\" type=\"number\" class=\"shiny-input-number form-control\" value=\"4\" data-update-on=\"change\" min=\"0.1\"/>\n</div>\n</div>\n```\n\n:::\n:::\n\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<div class=\"shiny-panel-conditional\" data-display-if=\"input.dist == &#39;Hipergeométrica&#39;\" data-ns-prefix=\"\">\n<div class=\"form-group shiny-input-container\">\n<label class=\"control-label\" id=\"Npop-label\" for=\"Npop\">Tamaño población (N):</label>\n<input id=\"Npop\" type=\"number\" class=\"shiny-input-number form-control\" value=\"1000\" data-update-on=\"change\" min=\"10\"/>\n</div>\n<div class=\"form-group shiny-input-container\">\n<label class=\"control-label\" id=\"K-label\" for=\"K\">Éxitos en población (K):</label>\n<input id=\"K\" type=\"number\" class=\"shiny-input-number form-control\" value=\"300\" data-update-on=\"change\" min=\"1\"/>\n</div>\n<div class=\"form-group shiny-input-container\">\n<label class=\"control-label\" id=\"m-label\" for=\"m\">Tamaño de muestra (m):</label>\n<input id=\"m\" type=\"number\" class=\"shiny-input-number form-control\" value=\"20\" data-update-on=\"change\" min=\"1\"/>\n</div>\n</div>\n```\n\n:::\n:::\n\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<div class=\"shiny-panel-conditional\" data-display-if=\"input.dist == &#39;Exponencial&#39;\" data-ns-prefix=\"\">\n<div class=\"form-group shiny-input-container\">\n<label class=\"control-label\" id=\"lambda_exp-label\" for=\"lambda_exp\">Lambda:</label>\n<input id=\"lambda_exp\" type=\"number\" class=\"shiny-input-number form-control\" value=\"1.5\" data-update-on=\"change\" min=\"0.1\"/>\n</div>\n</div>\n```\n\n:::\n:::\n\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<div class=\"form-group shiny-input-container\">\n<label class=\"control-label\" id=\"n-label\" for=\"n\">Tamaño de muestra (TCL):</label>\n<input id=\"n\" type=\"number\" class=\"shiny-input-number form-control\" value=\"30\" data-update-on=\"change\" min=\"1\"/>\n</div>\n```\n\n:::\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<div class=\"form-group shiny-input-container\">\n<label class=\"control-label\" id=\"Nsim-label\" for=\"Nsim\">Número de simulaciones:</label>\n<input id=\"Nsim\" type=\"number\" class=\"shiny-input-number form-control\" value=\"10000\" data-update-on=\"change\" min=\"1000\"/>\n</div>\n```\n\n:::\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<button id=\"simular\" type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-default action-button\"><span class=\"action-label\">Simular</span></button>\n```\n\n:::\n:::\n\n\n## Resultados\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<div class=\"shiny-plot-output html-fill-item\" id=\"plots\" style=\"width:100%;height:450px;\"></div>\n```\n\n:::\n:::\n\n\n\n::: {.cell context='server'}\n\n:::\n\npreservebfa6e71560ea3bf2\npreserve36259dfabade2843\n\n<!--html_preserve-->\n<script type=\"application/shiny-prerendered\" data-context=\"dependencies\">\n{\"type\":\"list\",\"attributes\":{},\"value\":[{\"type\":\"list\",\"attributes\":{\"names\":{\"type\"